          "startLine": 297,
          "endLine": 304,
          "quote": "            <p>\n              We inspected\n              <a href=\"https://wayou.github.io/t-rex-runner/\"\n                >wayou’s Chromium-derived browser edition</a\n              >\n              with REA. It returned the loaded <code>index.js</code>, including\n              this branch in the game’s update function:\n            </p>"
        }
